ightning-fast rallies as you explore different courts\u2014from vibrant urban parks to serene indoor arenas. With realistic physics and responsive controls, Badminton Smash VR delivers an exhilarating experience that captures the essence of the sport.\n\nAre you ready to smash your way to victory? Grab your racket and step into the game today!", "short_description": "Experience the thrill of badminton like never before in Badminton Smash VR! Dive into immersive indoor and outdoor courts, where you can choose from a variety of rackets to customize your playstyle. Perfect your smashes and finesse your volleys in dynamic environments that challenge your skills and reflexes."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://tulipapps.com/meta-quest-privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Tulip Apps", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.tulipapps.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "821934236779161"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "8939532742765004"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75630187_1280619696448294_5428893568350014404_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kcYqS3DajQoQ7kNvwGsrGZJ&_nc_oc=AdpU62mqw8NTw04j5-gsT14cZuPbiTL0fQ--b_-CtefvvGqstDZwscA